# Load-shed at 120 Hz, driven by the present cost (`cost`): three presents over 1.5 frames shed,
# the latch restores once the cost falls and its dwell has passed, sheds again inside the quick-
# reshed window (the dwell doubles) and restores, while typing goes on.

grid 16 80
style rainbow kitty
hz 120

at 0 pty "\e[9;1H$ "
at 0 env motion auto
at 700 key t
at 700 cost 2500000
